[ar:Laufey, Dan Wilson]
[ti:Promise]
[00:14.06] I made a promise
[00:20.06] To distance myself
[00:26.85] Took a flight, through aurora skies
[00:33.31] Honestly, I didn't think about
[00:37.87] How we didn't say goodbye
[00:43.02] Just, "See you very soon"
[00:49.59] It hurts to be something
[00:52.33] It's worse to be nothing
[00:56.13] With you
[01:00.83] 
[01:09.17] So I didn't call you
[01:15.09] For 16 long days
[01:21.80] And I should get a cigarette
[01:27.81] For so much restraint
[01:30.82] No matter how long I resist temptation
[01:38.82] I will always lose
[01:44.70] It hurts to be something
[01:47.39] It's worse to be nothing
[01:50.26] With you
[01:52.36] I've done the math, there's no solution
[01:58.24] We'll never last
[02:02.72] Why can't I let go of this?
